# Install as /etc/postfix/gregale-report-transports after substituting each
# verified sending domain. Use an anchored, escaped domain; never a wildcard
# over arbitrary addresses or domains. No postmap database build for regexp.
/^bounce\+[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}@example\.com$/ gregale-report:
